{%- comment -%}
  Paste this into the TRMNL Private Plugin "Markup" editor for the
  bus-grabo plugin (Polling strategy), "Full" tab.

  Two single-line "next bus" boards (not a multi-departure list - see
  fetch.mjs's nextDepartures()): line 525 at Mjörn (towards Gråbo) and line
  X3 at Gråbo busstation (towards Göteborg) - two DIFFERENT lines/buses
  that happen to meet at Gråbo, not one continuous route (see fetch.mjs's
  top-of-file "LINE CORRECTION" note for why this matters). Each board shows
  a random pixel-art bus icon (icon_url, re-picked every fetch, the two
  boards' icons guaranteed different from each other - see fetch.mjs's
  pickTwoDistinctIcons()), the ETD (immediate next departure) and the
  following scheduled departure time (next_departure_time - both lines run
  roughly hourly, so this is typically "this hour" / "next hour").

  Every text line uses "label" so size/font stays identical and pixelated
  throughout (see README's "Markup style" section) - matches the previous
  version's convention.

  Position map: a single generated PNG (bus_position.map_image_url) showing
  Sjövik -- Mjörn -- Gråbo as three dots on a line, with a marker for each
  departure's live GPS-derived position along that stretch (see fetch.mjs's
  renderPositionMap()/resolveRoute()/describeDeparturePosition()).

  IMPORTANT rendering rule (learned the hard way in weather-yr, applies to
  every <img> below): class="image image--contain image-dither" (not just
  "image"), and each icon is a single LONE <img> in its own row - never
  placed as a flex sibling of another <img>. A SECOND rule, learned the hard
  way in THIS plugin: a bare <div class="layout layout--row"> wrapper does
  NOT reliably give the <img> a fixed box on a real device - the bus icons
  rendered squashed into a tall narrow sliver instead of their real
  landscape shape, because the surrounding flex layout stretched the
  wrapper's cross-axis instead of respecting the <img>'s own width/height.
  weather-yr's icons never hit this because they're inside <table><td>
  cells, which size to their content regardless of the surrounding flex
  layout - so every icon here uses that same single-cell-table wrapper too.

  Bottom section: "Senaste position" (last seen) - one row per board, each
  repeating that board's own icon plus the nearest real bus stop name
  (last_seen.location_text - always a place name like "Mjörn" or "Göteborg",
  never a percentage-along-route figure, and shown even when the sighting
  is from that line running a different direction or route variant - see
  fetch.mjs's nearestStopName()) and a timestamp (last_seen.seen_at_display).
  Unlike bus_location above (which is often "unknown" between trips),
  last_seen is designed to always have something to show once any sighting
  has ever been recorded - see fetch.mjs's buildLastSeen().
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="layout layout--col gap--medium">

  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;">
    <tr><td style="border: none; padding: 0; text-align: center;"><img class="image image--contain image-dither" src="{{ bus_position.map_image_url }}" width="480" height="56" style="width: 480px; height: 56px;"></td></tr>
  </table>

  <div class="layout layout--row" style="justify-content: space-between;">
    <div class="label">Sjövik</div>
    <div class="label">Mjörn</div>
    <div class="label">Gråbo</div>
  </div>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;">
    <tr><td style="border: none; padding: 0; text-align: center;"><img class="image image--contain image-dither" src="{{ mjorn_to_grabo.icon_url }}" width="96" height="48" style="width: 96px; height: 48px;"></td></tr>
  </table>
  <div class="label">MJÖRN &gt; GRÅBO</div>
  {% if mjorn_to_grabo.has_departure %}
  <div class="label">ETD: {{ mjorn_to_grabo.estimated_time }}{% if mjorn_to_grabo.delay_minutes > 0 %} (+{{ mjorn_to_grabo.delay_minutes }}){% endif %}{% if mjorn_to_grabo.is_cancelled %} - INSTÄLLD{% endif %} ({{ mjorn_to_grabo.minutes_until }} min)</div>
  {% if mjorn_to_grabo.next_departure_time %}
  <div class="label">Nästa: {{ mjorn_to_grabo.next_departure_time }}</div>
  {% endif %}
  {% else %}
  <div class="label">Ingen avgång just nu</div>
  {% endif %}

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;">
    <tr><td style="border: none; padding: 0; text-align: center;"><img class="image image--contain image-dither" src="{{ grabo_to_goteborg.icon_url }}" width="96" height="48" style="width: 96px; height: 48px;"></td></tr>
  </table>
  <div class="label">GRÅBO &gt; GBG</div>
  {% if grabo_to_goteborg.has_departure %}
  <div class="label">ETD: {{ grabo_to_goteborg.estimated_time }}{% if grabo_to_goteborg.delay_minutes > 0 %} (+{{ grabo_to_goteborg.delay_minutes }}){% endif %}{% if grabo_to_goteborg.is_cancelled %} - INSTÄLLD{% endif %} ({{ grabo_to_goteborg.minutes_until }} min)</div>
  {% if grabo_to_goteborg.next_departure_time %}
  <div class="label">Nästa: {{ grabo_to_goteborg.next_departure_time }}</div>
  {% endif %}
  {% else %}
  <div class="label">Ingen avgång just nu</div>
  {% endif %}

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <div class="label">SENAST SEDD</div>

  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;">
    <tr><td style="border: none; padding: 0; text-align: center;"><img class="image image--contain image-dither" src="{{ mjorn_to_grabo.icon_url }}" width="64" height="32" style="width: 64px; height: 32px;"></td></tr>
  </table>
  <div class="label">MJÖRN &gt; GRÅBO ({{ mjorn_to_grabo.last_seen.bus_name | default: mjorn_to_grabo.line }})</div>
  <div class="label">Senaste position: {{ mjorn_to_grabo.last_seen.location_text }} - {{ mjorn_to_grabo.last_seen.seen_at_display }}</div>

  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;">
    <tr><td style="border: none; padding: 0; text-align: center;"><img class="image image--contain image-dither" src="{{ grabo_to_goteborg.icon_url }}" width="64" height="32" style="width: 64px; height: 32px;"></td></tr>
  </table>
  <div class="label">GRÅBO &gt; GBG ({{ grabo_to_goteborg.last_seen.bus_name | default: grabo_to_goteborg.line }})</div>
  <div class="label">Senaste position: {{ grabo_to_goteborg.last_seen.location_text }} - {{ grabo_to_goteborg.last_seen.seen_at_display }}</div>

</div>

<div class="title_bar">
  <span class="title">Bussar · Gråbo</span>
  <span class="instance">{{ updated_display }}</span>
</div>
